   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»roboMark«",
   "text": "<p>The intelligent automation solution for fast and precise tool marking – engineered for the highest production demands</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/company/contact\">Schedule a demo</a></p>",
