  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Laser marking system </h3> <h2> Precision That Is Visible for a Lifetime </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»roboMark« automatically labels tools with single- and multi-line labels, QR codes, barcodes, logos, and graphics. Thanks to a high-quality laser and dependable processes, it ensures unique tool identification. Seamless integration into existing production processes, as well as connectivity to third-party systems, ensures a continuous transfer of tool data. In this way, »roboMark« delivers greater transparency, process reliability, and efficiency in manufacturing.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/company/contact\">Learn more</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [],
