  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> For reproducible results </h3> <h2> Perfect Tool Positioning </h2>",
   "body": "<p>In combination with a robotic loading system, the ZOLLER »roboMark« laser marking system operates completely autonomously, reliably, and efficiently within the ZOLLER safety enclosure.</p> <p>Thanks to the multi-pallet system and the double gripper unit, this ZOLLER automation solution can process and document even large quantities fully automatically.</p> <p>A fume extraction unit with automatic filter monitoring and other customer-specific add-on solutions, such as the optional Weldon detection, complete the overall system.</p>",
